1397: Lyrics guidance beside Guidance (CFG), kept with the form, the draft, Retake and profiles. 1398 (RC7, Viktor's word): the spectrogram slice out of the section card; the scope keeps it whole. 1399: the medcard under the seeds: Score Planner | Music Tokens | The run. 1400: a light beside each guidance, his range by ear (the music 1.0–4.0, the lyrics 1.0–2.6, the two 0.4–1.0 apart), no clamp; a new song starts at 1.6 / 2.2. 1401: the three built-in profiles at 1.6 / 2.2; the third renamed «Musical Heresy of Creator's Ear», 10 minutes, his to save over. Krea 2 letters with the picture too (no Qwen-only note). Eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
